# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): on a MIDI clock (120 BPM, jitter), then stopped. Rendered by this branch and by main;
# a change that keeps the sound gives the same samples. Not a test of its own (no expectations).
pressure w0 0
pressure w1 0
pressure w2 0
pressure w3 0
pressure w4 0
pressure w5 0
pressure w6 0
pressure w7 0
pressure w8 0
pressure w9 0
pressure w10 0
pressure w11 0
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
clock 120 1
wait 3000
wav clock.wav
wait 12000
clock 0
wait 4000
wavstop
